# Counter-example: a lang:FeatureValue with NO lang:Denotation dispositioning it in the
# GMN symbology plane — no glyph, no named key, no imported alias binds it. The GMN
# linguistic coverage gate is total, so an undispositioned emitted term is a silent gap
# (fires lang:GmnUndispositionedTerm via the sh:sparql of lang:GmnLangCoverageShape). It is
# otherwise well-formed — a member of the feature inventory — so no other shape fires.

@prefix lang:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:valUndispositioned a lang:FeatureValue ;
    lang:inFeatureInventory lang:udUniversalFeatures .
